# Student Clearance System

A web-based Student Clearance System designed to streamline the clearance process by allowing students and school departments to manage, track, and approve clearance requirements electronically.

## 📖 Overview

The Student Clearance System replaces the traditional paper-based clearance process with a digital platform that enables faster approval, easier tracking, and centralized record management. Students can monitor their clearance status while departments can efficiently review and approve requests.

## ✨ Features

* User Authentication and Login
* Student Clearance Requests
* Department Approval Workflow
* Clearance Status Tracking
* Student Record Management
* Department Management
* Dashboard and Reports
* Activity Logs
* Responsive User Interface
* Search and Filter Functions

## 👥 User Roles

### Administrator

* Manage students
* Manage departments
* Monitor clearance records
* Generate reports
* Manage user accounts

### Department Staff

* Review clearance requests
* Approve or reject student clearances
* View department records

### Student

* Submit clearance requests
* Track clearance progress
* View approval status

